      "gloss": "sharp increase, dramatic rise, surge",
      "explanation": "A sudden and significant increase in quantity or number."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "04179_gekizou_ex1",
      "japanese": "{観光客|かんこうきゃく}が{激増|げきぞう}している。",
      "english": "The number of tourists is surging.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04179_gekizou_ex2",
      "japanese": "インターネット{利用者|りようしゃ}の{激増|げきぞう}により、サーバーが{混雑|こんざつ}した。",
      "english": "The server became congested due to the sharp increase in internet users.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "04179_gekizou_ex3",
      "japanese": "{感染者|かんせんしゃ}{数|すう}が{激増|げきぞう}したため、{対策|たいさく}が{必要|ひつよう}になった。",
      "english": "Countermeasures became necessary because the number of infected people surged.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "RELATED WORDS:\n・{急増|きゅうぞう} - rapid increase (similar but slightly less dramatic)\n・{増加|ぞうか} - increase (neutral, general term)\n・{増大|ぞうだい} - enlargement, growth\n\n{激増|げきぞう} emphasizes both speed and magnitude of increase.\n\nOPPOSITE:\n・{激減|げきげん} - sharp decrease, dramatic drop\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・〜が{激増|げきぞう}する (something surges)\n・{激増|げきぞう}している (is surging)\n\n[Register: Neutral to Formal, often used in news/reports]",
